<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 97,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 97,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's actual receipts 97,000 and Saturday's 19,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts mostly steady to firm compared with the mid-session Friday. Top $48.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>			    Country		  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    46.00 -47.00	   47.00 -48.00</p>
<p>few				 47.50		    48.50</p>
<p>limited interest few	  45.50		    46.50</p>
<p>Sowd - generally steady. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  40.00 -41.00	   41.00 -43.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   41.00 -43.00	   42.00 -45.00</p>
